# Normalize every text file to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The repo previously had no rules here and had drifted into a CRLF/LF mix
# (Rust sources and most CSVs were CRLF; shell scripts and Markdown were LF).
# Editing a CRLF file with any LF-writing tool then produced a whole-file
# diff that buried the real change. These rules make line endings a property
# of the repository instead of whichever editor touched a file last.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts fail outright if they ever pick up CRLF.
*.sh    text eol=lf

# Notebooks are JSON — keep them diffable as text.
*.ipynb text eol=lf

# Binary: never transform.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.zip   binary
